## 抽出結果サマリー

**Study Identification:**
- **Study ID:** Remiszewski2022
- **Author, Journal, Year:** Remiszewski et al., JAMA Psychiatry, 2022
- **Title:** Contrasting Case-Control and Normative Reference Approaches to Capture Clinically Relevant Structural Brain Abnormalities in Patients With First-Episode Psychosis Who Are Antipsychotic Naive

**NM2-1. Modeling Methods:**
- **GAMLSS** (Nonparametric Reg) - PCN toolkitとbrain charts toolkitを使用した事前学習済みノルマティブモデル

**NM2-2. Response Variable:**
- **SubV** (sMRI) - 皮質下体積（視床、海馬、扁桃体、尾状核、被殻、腹側間脳、脳幹）
- **CSF** (sMRI) - 脳室体積

**NM2-3. Explanatory Variables:**
- **Age** (Age-related)
- **Sex** (Demographics)
- **Site** (Site/Scanner) - キャリブレーションによるサイト効果調整

